sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as FastAPI App
    participant M as Middleware
    participant R as /v1/chat
    participant S as Support Service
    participant T as Transcript Store

    C->>A: POST /v1/chat + X-API-Key
    A->>M: resolve request id
    M->>R: request.state.request_id
    R->>R: validate ChatRequest
    R->>R: check API key and rate limit
    R->>S: answer(payload, request_id)
    S->>S: classify intent + redact PII
    S->>T: append turn
    S-->>R: ChatResponse
    R-->>C: 200 + X-Request-ID
